			"mark": "TALK_MARK_COMMON",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Neko",
					"Paimon"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 722130101,
					"content": "\"Celery\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130102,
					"content": "How's the statue?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722130103,
					"content": "That stone human is most skilled, meow meow meow.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130104,
					"content": "Is it done?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722130105,
					"content": "No, but before I knew it, he had brought a big, big stone over.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130106,
					"content": "He then started to knock on it, donk-donk-donk, all while muttering things about \"employer\" and \"salary.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130107,
					"content": "Speaking of which, I would like to ask: what is an \"envoyer,\" and what is \"celery\"?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130108,
					"content": "I think you mean \"employer\" and \"salary.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722130109,
					"content": "Basically, since you asked him to do something, he should be given something in return.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130110,
					"content": "Ah, is that the case? So humans are particular about such things... Alright. I shall permit him to scratch my ears.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130111,
					"content": "Uh, Paimon doesn't think that's enough...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130112,
					"content": "Is it not? Hmm, then perhaps I should give him something to eat.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130113,
					"content": "I think what he wants is Mora...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722130114,
					"content": "Mora? Are these things not for shoving inside the Offering Box? How strange. To think that humans were concerned about such things.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130115,
					"content": "Well, a salary is very important, actually.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722130116,
					"content": "Mmph. I will trust your words on account of the aid you've provided so far. I will speak to the stone human when we return.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130117,
					"content": "However, the stone human is no longer going donk-donk-donk. He seems to be carrying a short wooden pole, who knows what for...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130118,
					"content": "A wooden pole? Isn't statue-carving done with a hammer, a chisel, and stuff like that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722130119,
					"content": "Did his tools break or something...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722130120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722130120,
					"content": "#Oh brother. Come on then, {NICKNAME}, let's go find Mr. Ooshima. Sounds like he needs some help!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7221302,
			"completionStepIds": [],
